      "label": "military personnel",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who are familiar with or identify with the stereotype being mocked, specifically white people, as the meme is designed to ridicule them through a racially charged false analogy. The visual of a military personnel firing a weapon is used metaphorically to represent the 'attacking' or 'shooting down' of the stereotype, which is directed at white people.",
